# Agents Guide

## Virtual commands
- `uv run poe lint` → run full pre-commit suite  
- `uv run poe test` → coverage-tracked pytest  
- `uv run poe profile` → create data-profiling HTML  

## Coding Guidelines
{%- if with_databricks %}
- Target Databricks Runtime {{ databricks_runtime }} (Python {% if databricks_runtime == "17.3" or databricks_runtime == "16.4" %}3.12{% elif databricks_runtime == "15.4" %}3.11{% endif %}).
- Use pinned pandas/numpy/pyarrow versions matching the runtime.
- Prefer PySpark DataFrame API for large-scale data; use pandas for small datasets.
{%- else %}
- Target Python {{ python_version }} (see `pyproject.toml`).
{%- endif %}
- Disallow old `typing.List`, `typing.Dict`; use built-ins.  
- Line length 100; follow `ruff` auto-fix suggestions.  
- Public functions need **NumPy-style** docstrings.  
- Prefer vectorised `pandas` / `numpy` over Python loops.
